I 1,215,18. 19.\n— 2〉 m.\n — a〉 Haselhuhn Ind. St. 15,412.\n — b〉 N. pr.\n — α〉 Pl. eines Volkes.\n — β〉 eines Mannes.\n— 3〉 *f. ई\n — a〉 Mucuna pruriens^1.\n — b〉 = जाङ्गुल 3〉a〉.\n — c〉 Bein. der Gaurī GAL.; vgl. जाङ्गुल 3〉b〉.\n— 4〉 n.\n — a〉 Wildpret.\n — b〉 Fleisch BĀLAR. 54,3.\n — c〉 fehlerhaft für जाङ्गुल 1〉b〉 MED. 1. 94.\n[1] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk, Thomas Malten on 20241207. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/PWK/issues/111.", "gloss_language": "de"}], "synonyms": ["जांगल", "जाङ्गलं", "जाङ्गलः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["jAMgala", "jANgalaM", "jANgalaH"]}], "jaNgalapaTa": [{"id": "jaNgalapaTa", "headword": "जङ्गलपथ", "headword_slp1": "jaNgalapaTa", "fold": "jaNgalapaTa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "*जङ्गलपथ m. eine öde Gegend.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "jaNgah": [{"id": "jaNgah", "headword": "जङ्गह्", "headword_slp1": "jaNgah", "fold": "jaNgah", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "!√जङ्गह् Intens. (nur ज꣫ङ्गहे) zappeln, sich bewegen ṚV. 1,126,6.\n— Mit अभिवि zucken AV. 5,19,4.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "jaNgari": [{"id": "jaNgAri", "headword": "जङ्गारि", "headword_slp1": "jaNgAri", "fold": "jaNgari", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "जङ्गारि m. N. pr. eines Mannes MBH. 13,4,57. जङ्घारि v. l.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "jaNgiqa": [{"id": "jaNgiqa", "headword": "जङ्गिड", "headword_slp1": "jaNgiqa", "fold": "jaNgiqa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "जङ्गिड꣫ m. eine best. Pflanze.", "gloss_language": "de"}], "synonyms": ["जङ्गिडः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["jaNgiqaH"]}], "jaNgula": [{"id": "jaNgula", "headword": "जङ्गुल", "headword_slp1": "jaNgula", "fold": "jaNgula", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-